From 384403d8220cfa0e109301dbe6de41d9d93412e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "claude[bot]" <41898282+claude[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 11:24:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ci: generate blog hero variants, build dist before serve
 tests, unblock the env guard

- web-serve-check: run generate-blog-hero-variants before
  check-blog-hero-variants (the -480/-768 outputs are gitignored).
- web-serve-check / web-lint: restore-or-build the verified web dist
  (shared web-dist-v3 node24 cache key) before the unit tests, since the
  serve-*.test.ts suites spawn serve.mjs, which needs dist/public/index.html.
- Supply inert, empty VITE_FB_PIXEL_ID_* / VITE_GTAG_* values to every CI
  web build and provenance-verify step so the env-placeholder guard passes
  without secrets. Empty IDs initialise no analytics; this artefact is
  never deployed (production is built by Replit Autoscale).

Workflow edits authorised by the repository owner for this task.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .github/workflows/seo-regression.yml  | 17 ++++++++++
 .github/workflows/web-lint.yml        | 36 ++++++++++++++++++++
 .github/workflows/web-serve-check.yml | 49 ++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 3 files changed, 93 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/seo-regression.yml b/.github/workflows/seo-regression.yml
